### 4. Independent image inspection with the pinned container

Ran `sfdisk`, `fsck.exfat`, loop-attached the partition (`offset=1048576`,
`sizelimit=68157440`), mounted it read-only, and asserted the tree.

```shell
docker run --rm -i --privileged --network none \
  -v /tmp/sbc-f3-final.Zs2zuG:/work:ro \
  -e TAGS="<51 comma-separated PLATFORM_TAGS>" \
  sbc-imager-assembler:local bash -s
```

`sfdisk -d`:

```text
label: dos
label-id: 0x00000000
device: /work/demo.img
unit: sectors
sector-size: 512

/work/demo.img1 : start=        2048, size=      133120, type=7
PARTITION_ASSERT=one partition type=7 start=2048
```

Exactly one partition; type `7`; start LBA `2048` (0x800).

`fsck.exfat -n`:

```text
exfatprogs version : 1.2.0
/dev/loop1: clean. directories 75, files 10
FSCK_EXIT=0
