### 5. Linux privileged integration suite

**Status: carried forward, NOT run fresh.**

The host is macOS; this environment has no Linux kernel/loop device and `sudo`
requires an interactive password:

```text
$ sudo -n true
sudo: a password is required
exit 1
```

The requested `sudo -E env "PATH=$PATH" uv run pytest -m integration -q` was not
run on Linux, so no fresh Linux integration result is claimed here.

Carried-forward evidence: the prior F3 run approved at `98919d3` with all 3
integration tests passing. That result remains relevant because the hardening
range does not modify assembler behavior:

```shell
git diff 98919d3..13b6751 -- \
  src/sbc_imager/assembler.py \
  src/sbc_imager/assembler_steps.py \
  src/sbc_imager/assembler_verify.py \
  src/sbc_imager/mbr.py
# (empty; 0 diff lines)
```

The range `98919d3..13b6751` changes `Dockerfile`, `docs/*`, `AGENTS.md`,
`cannoli.py`, `cli.py`, `config.py`, `imaging_write.py`, `planner.py`, and unit
tests only; `tests/integration/` is unchanged. The independent macOS Docker E2E
above also exercises the Linux assembler/verifier path on the rebuilt container,
but it is not a substitute for the privileged Linux test run.

### 6. Image dry-run / enumerator safety

No real card reader was present. macOS `diskutil list` showed only:

```text
/dev/disk0 (internal, physical)
/dev/disk3 (synthesized)
/dev/disk4 (disk image)
```

Real-environment dry run (no reader):

```shell
uv run sbc-imager image --image /tmp/sbc-f3-final.Zs2zuG/demo.img --dry-run
IMAGE_REAL_ENV_EXIT=2
stderr: Error: no safe removable disks found; connect a USB card reader
```

The internal disk was not offered.

To exercise the successful dry-run path, used the repository's documented fake
diskutil fixtures (`tests/fixtures/diskutil/`) through a temporary `diskutil`
shim on `PATH`, so the real `enumerate_disks`, `render_table`, and CLI dry-run
code ran without touching hardware:

```shell
printf '1\n' | PATH="/tmp/sbc-f3-final.Zs2zuG/fakebin:$PATH" \
  uv run sbc-imager image --image /tmp/sbc-f3-final.Zs2zuG/demo.img --dry-run
IMAGE_DRYRUN_EXIT=0
```

stdout:

```text
┏━━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
┃ Identifier ┃ Label  ┃ Size      ┃ Model         ┃ Protocol ┃ Serial       ┃
┡━━━━━━━━━━━━╇━━━━━━━━╇━━━━━━━━━━━╇━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╇━━━━━━━━━━╇━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┩
│ disk9      │ SDCARD │ 59.478GiB │ SanDisk Ultra │ USB      │ 0123456789AB │
└────────────┴────────┴───────────┴───────────────┴──────────┴──────────────┘
