Only the external USB removable disk (`disk9`) was offered. The internal disk
(`disk0`), disk image (`disk4`), boot disk (`disk10`), and built-in SD reader
(`disk11`) were all filtered out. No write occurred: the dry-run path returns
before `write_image`, no `sudo`/writer was invoked, the image file stayed at
mtime `2026-10-19T01:46:11-0400` with the same SHA-256, and no real disk was
opened.

